 "description": "<p>Halloween lingerie lives or dies on the details, and this set front-loads three of them: a black cobweb hip skirt, a matching thong, and a leg loop that ties the theme together. The mesh webbing is cut to read at a glance, even across a dim room.</p>\n<p>Construction is polyester, which keeps the price sane and the care simple. The skirt sits on a 72 cm waistband, the thong stretches from 66 to 120 cm, and the whole set suits roughly 40-60 kg - a range the elastic waist makes forgiving.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Material: polyester</li>\n<li>Includes: hip skirt, thong, leg loop</li>\n<li>Style: Halloween cobweb</li>\n<li>Color: black</li>\n<li>Sizing: one size, waist 72 cm, thong waist 66-120 cm, 40-60 kg</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Pair it with a witch hat for the full costume or wear it on its own when the costume is the point.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Black Halloween cobweb hip skirt set with thong and leg loop, one size for 40-60 kg in polyester mesh.</p>\n",
